 .../dts/qcom/sc8180x-microsoft-cambria.dts    |  38 +
 .../dts/qcom/sc8180x-microsoft-carina.dts     |  50 +
 .../dts/qcom/sc8180x-microsoft-caspar.dts     |  38 +
